Coach Tucker's a person of value I admire and respect!

527
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,500
現在去打敗你們的對手
Now let's go take it to these guys,

528
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:37,440
我很肯定他們肯定有別的才華
who I'm sure are blessed with other gifts

