but are not great at football!

530
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:39,760
沖啊
Let's go!

531
00:19:44,812 --> 00:19:46,033
你敢相信他們居然買賬嗎
Can you believe they bought it?

532
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:47,880
買什么
Bought what?

533
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:53,180
我們生活在敏感的年代
We live in sensitive times.

534
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:54,020
沒有嗎
Nothing?

535
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:56,860
完全沒腦子嗎
No brain at all?

536
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:59,480
這肯定要影響到我事業了
Well, that's gonna hurt my career.

537
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:03,280
所以如果我們想成功 就得與時俱進
So we must evolve if we want to succeed.

538
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:11,180
有時候這需要我們分享自己的脆弱
Sometimes that requires us to share our vulnerabilities...

539
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:15,260
才能用嶄新的視角看待彼此
...so that we can see one another in a new way.

540
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:16,880
你還好嗎
How are you doing?

541
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,350
我想我同意這事
I think I'm okay with it.

542
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:20,760
我很害怕
I'm scared.

543
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:25,220
但知道會有你陪我讓我感到不那么害怕了
But it's less scary knowing I'm going through it with you.

544
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:31,120
今天的無宗教性
That concludes today's non-denominational

545
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:33,200
鼓舞宣言就到此結束啦
inspirational affirmation.

546
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:36,280
祝你有順你意的一天
Have the day that's right for you.

547
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,060
看看你們這群小王八蛋還有什么能抱怨
Let's see those little bastards complain about that.

548
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,280
慘了
Oh, no!

549
00:20:44,490 --> 00:20:46,220
沒錯 抬高膝蓋
That's right guys. High knees.

550
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,340
抬高膝蓋
High knees.

551
00:20:47,901 --> 00:20:49,022
左方有蘇聯共匪
