552
00:20:49,931 --> 00:20:51,182
右方有蘇聯共匪
Commie to your right.

553
00:20:52,031 --> 00:20:53,471
腳別拖泥帶水啊 平托斯基
Stop dragging Pitkowski.

554
00:20:53,471 --> 00:20:54,971
他們要來搶走你的心上人啦
They are coming after your sweet heart.

555
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,240
你知道他們怎么摧殘了波蘭嗎
You know what they did to Poland?

556
00:20:56,631 --> 00:20:57,611
我很想叫停這一切
Well, I wanna stop this.

557
00:20:57,611 --> 00:21:00,001
但執導手冊里完全沒寫到有關共黨的東西
But there is nothing in the guidelines about communists.

558
00:21:00,151 --> 00:21:02,421
我們像個嬉皮士這么嗨高高[吸大麻]
Now we are high like a hippie.

559
00:21:02,651 --> 00:21:05,661
-彎下腰像個基... -好了 杰 停下
- We are bending over like a ga... - Ok, shut it down Jay.

560
00:21:06,021 --> 00:21:08,551
好啦 各位 用我教的方法喝水
Alright, boys. Hydrate like I tought you.

561
00:21:10,600 --> 00:21:11,120
很乖
Attaboy.

562
00:21:13,660 --> 00:21:14,620
這就對了
There you go.
